abstract: "GenAI can transform educational assessments by improving efficiency, engagement, equity, and personalization, but without shared evaluation standards, AI-generated assessments risk low-quality outcomes. This project analyzes over 250 recent research studies to identify leading evaluation practices and create guidance for schools, EdTech developers, and measurement researchers."
keywords:
  - generative AI
  - educational assessment
  - systematic literature review
  - item generation
  - formative feedback
  - automated item scoring
  - large language models
  - inter-rater reliability
